+A coordinator resolves a review item by selecting one candidate revision as the visit's current revision. The store does not compose or edit revisions; a coordinator who needs a corrected visit submits it as a new revision against the selected current revision. Resolution records the coordinator's identity, the selected revision, and every contributing submission ID, and clears the visit's unresolved flag (REC-006). Losing revisions remain retrievable in submission history; they no longer constitute the current state.
 
